WEBVTT

00:47:57.163 --> 00:48:00.163
and I'm also a believer
in [thoughtful] disagreement,

00:48:00.187 --> 00:48:03.149
I think, Corey,
we're passionate disbelievers

00:48:03.173 --> 00:48:08.124
in the spreading of irrational hatred.

00:48:08.148 --> 00:48:09.828
Like, instinctual irrational hatred

00:48:09.852 --> 00:48:14.346
and I feel like the stakes
are so high right now, that if --

00:48:15.371 --> 00:48:17.504
RD: But will you fight for that?

00:48:17.942 --> 00:48:19.093
In other words,

00:48:19.117 --> 00:48:23.046
when somebody's going to punch back --

00:48:23.070 --> 00:48:24.887
Because this is what's needed.

00:48:24.911 --> 00:48:26.871
If somebody's going to punch back

00:48:26.895 --> 00:48:29.649
because you're saying
something that's true

00:48:29.673 --> 00:48:32.945
and controversial,